Significance: minor
Type: added

Issue the tk_ai visitor cookie from the server through a new POST /woocommerce-analytics/v1/visitor endpoint, with SameSite=Lax and a one-year expiry that rolls once per browser session, so it is sent on the navigation that follows an ad click and is outside WebKit's caps on script-written cookies. The client script no longer writes the cookie unless the endpoint cannot issue one.
